            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>At the time of the assessment, we notice air leakage on the followings:

-Attic hatch

-Main floor back windows

-Receptacles

-Electrical Panel

-Header joist

-Woodstove chimney

-Pony wall junction with the foundation wall

-Hood fan

</airSeal>
                <ceilings>At the time of the inspection the attic insulation was R-28. We recommend adding insulation to meet the city standard of R-60.</ceilings>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
